CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LehuaIntro::
    .string "A flame follows the dancer\n"
    .string "who knows its rhythm!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LehuaDefeat::
    .string "You broke my rhythm!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LehuaPostBattle::
    .string "You could've worked the gates\n"
    .string "and slipped past me.\p"
    .string "But you chose the fire!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_KeahiIntro::
    .string "A strong flame bends.\n"
    .string "It doesn't hesitate!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_KeahiDefeat::
    .string "You took control of the tempo!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_KeahiPostBattle::
    .string "Leilani won't give you time\n"
    .string "to settle in. Stay sharp.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LeilaniIntro::
    .string "So, you made it through my\n"
    .string "flames. Maybe you danced\n"
    .string "around them. Maybe you came\l"
    .string "straight through my Fire\n"
    .string "Dancers. Either way, you\n"
    .string "chose your own path.\p"
    .string "Fire doesn't wait for anyone.\n"
    .string "Hesitate, and it takes control.\l"
    .string "Move with confidence, and even\n"
    .string "the hottest flame can follow\n"
    .string "your lead.\p"
    .string "I'm Leilani, Leader of the\n"
    .string "Cerulean Gym.\p"
    .string "Show me how you move when the\n"
    .string "heat is on!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LeilaniDefeat::
    .string "Beautiful! You never let the\n"
    .string "flame control the battle.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LeilaniBadge::
    .string "You've earned the Ember Badge.\p"
    .string "It proves you can keep your\n"
    .string "head when the battle speeds up,\l"
    .string "and push back when the\n"
    .string "pressure's on.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LeilaniTM39::
    .string "Take this, too. TM39 contains\n"
    .string "WILL-O-WISP.\p"
    .string "Fire isn't only about power.\p"
    .string "Burn an opponent, take the edge\n"
    .string "off its physical attacks, and\l"
    .string "force it to fight at your pace.\p"
    .string "Control the battle, and the\n"
    .string "pressure stays yours.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiFirstApproach::
    .string "So, this is Leilani's Gym.\n"
    .string "Fire this time.\p"
    .string "You've got two ways through.\n"
    .string "Work the switches and control\l"
    .string "the flame gates, or head\n"
    .string "straight up and face the\l"
    .string "Fire Dancers.\p"
    .string "Water, Ground, and Rock\n"
    .string "attacks will serve you\l"
    .string "well here.\p"
    .string "But don't get careless.\n"
    .string "Fire Pokémon can burn you,\l"
    .string "and Leilani likes keeping\n"
    .string "you on the back foot.\p"
    .string "I've got a Fire Pokémon\n"
    .string "with me, too.\p"
    .string "Want a quick battle before\n"
    .string "you go in?\l"
    .string "Consider it practice.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAccept::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "Show me how you handle\n"
    .string "the heat.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiDecline::
    .string "Fair enough.\p"
    .string "Just remember: don't let\n"
    .string "Leilani set the pace.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiWin::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "You kept your footing.\p"
    .string "Leilani's Pokémon will be\n"
    .string "stronger than mine, though.\p"
    .string "What worked here might not\n"
    .string "be enough once she starts\l"
    .string "controlling the battle.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiLoss::
    .string "You saw what Fire can do.\n"
    .string "That was the point.\p"
    .string "Try me again whenever\n"
    .string "you're ready.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryOffer::
    .string "Want another shot?$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryYes::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "Show me what you learned.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryNo::
    .string "Fair enough.\p"
    .string "I'll be right here.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiBeforeLeilani::
    .string "That'll do.\p"
    .string "Water, Ground, and Rock\n"
    .string "are your best answers.\p"
    .string "If you want the safer route,\n"
    .string "work the switches and control\l"
    .string "the flame gates.\p"
    .string "If you want the direct route,\n"
    .string "the Fire Dancers are waiting.\p"
    .string "Either way, don't let\n"
    .string "Leilani control the pace.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRepeatHint::
    .string "Need the short version?\p"
    .string "Water, Ground, Rock.\p"
    .string "Switches control the\n"
    .string "flame gates.\p"
    .string "Straight ahead means\n"
    .string "fighting the Fire Dancers.\p"
    .string "And watch out for burns.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiPostBadgePracticed::
    .string "Nice work.\p"
    .string "Leilani tried to keep you\n"
    .string "reacting to her.\p"
    .string "You took control instead.\p"
    .string "That Ember Badge proves it.\p"
    .string "TM39 is WILL-O-WISP.\p"
    .string "A burn can take the edge off\n"
    .string "a physical attacker before\l"
    .string "it gets rolling.\p"
    .string "Once you get moving,\n"
    .string "keep the pressure on.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiPostBadgeSkipped::
    .string "You skipped my warm-up\n"
    .string "and still beat Leilani?\p"
    .string "Not bad.\p"
    .string "You figured out the pace\n"
    .string "without me.\p"
    .string "That Ember Badge is yours.\p"
    .string "TM39 is WILL-O-WISP.\p"
    .string "A burn can take the edge off\n"
    .string "a physical attacker before\l"
    .string "it gets rolling.\p"
    .string "Keep that momentum.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "CERULEAN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: LEILANI\p"
    .string "The Dancing Flame!$"
